  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"代理商-素材管理\"],\"business_line\":[\"代理商\"],\"capability_summary\":\"用户可以通过传入视频id和投放设置(setting)创建对应的前测任务，使用有一定限制，如同一素材5次/24H、同一代理商50000素材/24H等。\",\"id\":\"diagnosis_task.agent.create\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/diagnosis_task/agent/create/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1816970745502732\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"access_token.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"创建前测任务需要授权access_token，可通过此接口获取\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"return_code.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"创建前测任务的应答中返回码和返回信息的说明需要参考此文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"1816970745502732\",\"supplemental_knowledge\":[],\"title\":\"代理商创建前测任务\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-0ODN3mZV\">通过此接口，用户可以通过传入视频id和投放设置(setting)创建对应的前测任务。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-lM63xQ1m\">使用限制：</p><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-1ep5wwgcfg5c00\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-PPTkte90\">同一素材 5 次/24H</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-tcA4KPVl\">同一代理商 50000 素材/24H</li></ul><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3o9ghxkvaa6000\"><br/></p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-4ank1462sbw000\">⚠️ 低效检测能力已下限</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-t1vH1De5\"><br/></p><div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A1799011300133898%2C%22docLibId%22%3A1743864733602830%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZUdK4%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"> </div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-56pYUgks\" id=\"h346b9f0-56pYUgks\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-RnYnMRJH\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/diagnosis_task/agent/create/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/diagnosis_task/agent/create/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1816970745502732\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-FNjK16OH\" id=\"h346b9f0-FNjK16OH\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-SFpCZd6n\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-9YoRlmTe\" id=\"h346b9f0-9YoRlmTe\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">请求消息类型<br/>允许值: <code>application/json</code></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-mKFPM0Rq\" id=\"h346b9f0-mKFPM0Rq\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">agent_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-CVgjsNMP\">代理商id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ALF2Bb1j\">客户id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">video_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Vk5lMppN\">视频id列表（长度限制100）</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">diagnose_config</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-T25ey6yO\">前测setting (低效能力已下线，可不传)</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">platform</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">投放平台 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-M0BIZOam\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-6Tm6aYh5\"><code>AD</code> AD</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-YXGY0iBd\"><code>QIANCHUAN</code> QIANCHUAN</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-5etwswlu1jk000\"><code>LOCAL</code> 本地推</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">external_action</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">优化目标 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-i4lAJkOU\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-9oTP9ODX\"><code>AD_APP_ACTIVATE</code> AD：应用-激活</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-3M86OObQ\"><code>AD_APP_AUTH</code> AD：应用-授信</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-iIBM5SXq\"><code>AD_APP_BOOK</code> AD：应用-预约表单</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-AQj5k89r\"><code>AD_APP_BUY</code> AD：应用-APP内付费</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-PVn4VsT7\"><code>AD_APP_CLICKS</code> AD：应用-点击量</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ljU0GJjt\"><code>AD_APP_DETAIL</code> AD：应用-APP内详情页到站UV</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-JZYOqlWi\"><code>AD_APP_DOWNLOADED</code> AD：应用-下载完成</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-INLNQBJ4\"><code>AD_APP_INSTALLED</code> AD：应用-安装完成</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-IMPtQUOh\"><code>AD_APP_KEY_BEHAVIOR</code> AD：应用-关键行为</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-NbOpPMId\"><code>AD_APP_ORDER</code> AD：应用-APP内下单</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-GotT0LMy\"><code>AD_APP_PAY</code> AD：应用-付费</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-QbYfUAyv\"><code>AD_APP_PRE_AUTH</code> AD：应用-预授信</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ZHDWSitz\"><code>AD_APP_PRE_DOWNLOAD</code> AD：应用-预约下载</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-