code>FEMALE</code> 女</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">audience_age</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"> 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-ngAdRdcX\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-cdozT31J\"><code>ALL</code> 不限</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-55GdZ7gi\"><code>18-23</code> 18-23</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-7KtWLzVb\"><code>24-30</code> 24-30</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-SnFC9pKk\"><code>31-40</code> 31-40</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-m0k7SkaZ\"><code>41-49</code> 41-49</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-DVmJ2Hi8\"><code>50</code> 50+</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">audience_region</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\">受众地区，传入二级行政区域（市）的code，行政区域接口</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">audience_network</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"> 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-jIWScK91\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-edxRh0o9\"><code>ALL</code> 不限</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-QwBXiPBk\"><code>5G</code> 5G</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-PrpSlA1J\"><code>4G</code> 4G</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-zp7vLnKK\"><code>3G</code> 3G</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-eqtq0QbL\"><code>2G</code> 2G</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-dQy1aJjz\"><code>WIFI</code> wifi</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><secti